// The content store (ADR-0004).
//
// Three compacted topics, and the shape matters because the obvious
// single-topic design does not actually version anything:
//
//   andara.content.blobs.v1     key = sha256(body)   — immutable, permanent
//   andara.content.versions.v1  key = packID@version — full history retained
//   andara.content.active.v1    key = packID         — the only mutable pointer
//
// Compaction keeps the newest value per key. Keying history by packID@version
